---
<Layout title="SHIUI — Hinomaru Ink UI Kit · 111 elements / 24 blocks">
<div class="flex justify-center border-b-[1.5px] border-sumi bg-paper py-2">
  <a href="https://www.producthunt.com/products/shiui-hinomaru-ink-ui-kit?embed=true&utm_source=badge-featured&utm_medium=badge&utm_campaign=badge-shiui" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img alt="SHIUI - Hinomaru Ink Web UI Kit in Japanese Hinomaru style | Product Hunt" width="250" height="54" src="https://api.producthunt.com/widgets/embed-image/v1/featured.svg?post_id=1245868&theme=light&t=1789310920511" /></a>
</div>
<header class="sticky top-0 z-50 border-b-[1.5px] border-sumi bg-paper">
  <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-wrap items-center gap-3 px-4 py-2.5 sm:px-6">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="h-8 w-8 rounded-full bg-shu"></span><span><span class="block font-display text-[18px] font-bold leading-none">SHIUI 詩</span><span class="block font-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] opacity-60">Hinomaru ink kit</span></span></div>
    <nav class="ml-2 hidden items-center gap-5 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] md:flex"><a href="#elements" class="link-brush">Elements</a><a href="#blocks" class="link-brush">Blocks</a><a href="#tokens" class="link-brush">Tokens</a></nav>
    <div class="ml-auto flex items-center gap-2"><span class="hidden items-center gap-2 border-[1.5px] border-sumi px-3 py-1.5 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase sm:inline-flex"><span class="h-2 w-2 animate-pulse bg-shu"></span>111 live</span><a href="#blocks" class="border-[1.5px] border-sumi bg-sumi px-4 py-1.5 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-paper">Get the kit →</a></div>
  </div>
</header>
<section class="border-b-[1.5px] border-sumi">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-0 px-4 py-8 sm:px-6 md:grid-cols-[1fr_300px]">
    <div class="border-[1.5px] border-sumi bg-paper p-6 sm:p-10">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em]"><span class="h-[1.5px] w-8 bg-shu"></span><span>Ukiyo-inspired UI kit — for English interfaces</span></div>
      <h1 class="mt-4 font-display text-[52px] font-bold leading-[0.92] sm:text-[84px]">Paper.<br/>Ink. <span class="text-shu">Sun.</span></h1>
      <p class="mt-5 max-w-[52ch] font-sans text-[15px] leading-relaxed opacity-75">SHIUI is a reusable component kit drawn like a Hinomaru poster — flat 2D, neat 1.5px lines, zero shadows, three colours only. Every card below is <b>live</b>: press it, flip it, dismiss it. Like what you see? Copy its import or full source straight from the card.</p>
      <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a href="#elements" class="ink-wipe inline-flex items-center gap-2 border-[1.5px] border-sumi bg-shu px-5 py-2.5 font-sans text-[13px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-paper">Browse elements ↓</a><a href="#tokens" class="ink-wipe inline-flex items-center gap-2 border-[1.5px] border-sumi px-5 py-2.5 font-sans text-[13px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em]">Copy tokens</a></div>
      <div class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-3 divide-x divide-sumi border-[1.5px] border-sumi text-center">
        <div class="p-3"><div class="font-display text-[26px] font-bold">111</div><div class="font-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] opacity-60">Live elements</div></div>
        <div class="p-3"><div class="font-display text-[26px] font-bold">24</div><div class="font-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] opacity-60">Blocks</div></div>
        <div class="p-3"><div class="font-display text-[26px] font-bold text-shu">3</div><div class="font-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] opacity-60">Colours</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="relative flex min-h-95 flex-col items-center justify-center overflow-hidden border-[1.5px] border-sumi bg-paper-deep md:ml-4 md:mt-0 mt-4">
      <div data-sun class="h-44 w-44 rounded-full bg-shu"></div>
      <span class="vertical-rl absolute right-3 top-4 font-display text-[15px] font-bold tracking-[0.34em]">日の丸、紙と墨</span>
      <span class="vertical-rl absolute left-3 top-4 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] opacity-60">Fig. 00 — Hinomaru</span>
      <div class="absolute bottom-0 flex w-full items-stretch justify-center gap-0 border-t-[1.5px] border-sumi bg-paper"><span class="flex-1 border-r-[1.5px] border-sumi py-2.5 text-center font-display text-[18px] font-bold">入</span><span class="flex-1 border-r-[1.5px] border-sumi py-2.5 text-center font-display text-[18px] font-bold">口</span><span class="flex-1 py-2.5 text-center font-display text-[18px] font-bold text-shu">詩</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section id="tokens" class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-10 sm:px-6">
  <div class="flex items-center gap-3 border-y-[1.5px] border-sumi py-2"><span class="bg-shu px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[11px] font-semibold text-paper">00</span><span class="font-display text-[16px] font-bold">Tokens — three colours, three voices, one line</span><span class="mx-1 h-px flex-1 bg-sumi/30"></span><span class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] opacity-60">Shiui / Kit</span></div>
  <div class="mt-5 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3">
    <div class="border-[1.5px] border-sumi bg-paper p-5"><div class="h-16 border-[1.5px] border-sumi bg-paper"></div><div class="mt-3 font-display text-[18px] font-bold">Paper — #e5e3dc</div><div class="font-mono text-[11px] opacity-60">GROUND · WASHI · MARGIN</div><p class="mt-2 text-[13px] opacity-70">Every surface. Breathe first, ink second.</p></div>
    <div class="border-[1.5px] border-sumi bg-paper p-5"><div class="h-16 border-[1.5px] border-sumi bg-sumi"></div><div class="mt-3 font-display text-[18px] font-bold">Sumi — #2a2926</div><div class="font-mono text-[11px] opacity-60">LINE · TYPE · FRAME</div><p class="mt-2 text-[13px] opacity-70">Every border and body word. 1.5px, never shadow.</p></div>
    <div class="border-[1.5px] border-shu bg-paper p-5"><div class="h-16 border-[1.5px] border-shu bg-shu"></div><div class="mt-3 font-display text-[18px] font-bold text-shu">Shu — #e14d2a</div><div class="font-mono text-[11px] opacity-60">SUN · SEAL · SIGNAL</div><p class="mt-2 text-[13px] opacity-70">One accent, spent sparingly — sun, seal, shout.</p></div>
  </div>
</section>
<main id="elements" class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 sm:px-6">
  <div class="mt-2 flex items-end justify-between border-b-[3px] border-sumi pb-3"><div><div class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-shu">The catalogue</div><h2 class="font-display text-[34px] font-bold leading-none">111 live elements</h2></div><div class="hidden text-right font-mono text-[10px] uppercase leading-relaxed tracking-[0.18em] opacity-60 sm:block">Try it on the card, then<br/>copy import or source</div></div>
<section class="py-8">
  <div class="flex items-center gap-3 border-y-[1.5px] border-sumi py-2"><span class="bg-sumi px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[11px] font-semibold text-paper">01</span><span class="font-display text-[17px] font-bold">Buttons & actions</span><span class="mx-1 hidden h-px flex-1 bg-sumi/30 sm:block"></span><span class="hidden font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] opacity-60 sm:block">one system — 44px base, shu shouts once</span></div>
  <div class="mt-4 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2">
<article class="group border-[1.5px] border-sumi bg-paper transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-paper-deep/40">
